---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <span>The Book of Life, by <a href="/about">Robat Das Orvi</a>, {year}</span>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    /* Was rgba(122,110,101,0.5), which composites to #b7afa8 on --bg and
       measures 1.91:1, far below the 4.5:1 needed for readable text. The
       half-opacity was doing the work of a lighter colour; using the token
       at full strength gives 4.86:1 and looks near-identical. */
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .site-footer a { color: var(--text-2); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--link-line); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style> 